{
	"name": "sprkly: every action in one run",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "831ef5f0-94e8-4a35-9dd7-e683c1f33a21",
			"name": "Overview",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-540,
				80
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Try every sprkly action in one run\n\n### How it works\n- Click Execute workflow. Each sprkly action runs once, from left to right.\n- It reads your API key and your connected accounts.\n- It adds a picture from a link. Then it downloads the same picture and uploads it.\n- It schedules one post 30 days from now, with the uploaded picture.\n- It reads the post, changes its caption and lists your scheduled posts.\n- The last step deletes the post, so nothing is published.\n- The External ID `demo-<run id>` gives every run its own post.\n- If the post is not scheduled, the run stops at **Stop: read the error**.\n- The two triggers below start on their own when the workflow is active.\n\n### Setup\n- Needs the n8n-nodes-sprkly community node (Settings, Community Nodes).\n- Add your sprkly API key to every sprkly node. API docs: https://sprkly.app/docs/api\n- In **Settings**, change account to one of your own accounts, written platform:handle.\n\n### Customize\n- Change daysAhead or imageUrl in **Settings**.\n- Remove **Delete a post** to keep the post. It then goes out on its day.\n- More: https://github.com/ahlanlhw/n8n-nodes-sprkly",
				"height": 900,
				"width": 480,
				"color": 1
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "cea0cb61-3d9e-4b9e-8eff-aeb0a74f58ec",
			"name": "Note: your account",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				100,
				80
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Your account\nChange account to one of your own accounts, written platform:handle. Use one account, so the demo makes one post.",
				"height": 180,
				"width": 400,
				"color": 7
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "66eaac0e-2b22-4376-8e8b-782855e4786f",
			"name": "Note: read the error",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				1700,
				620
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Not scheduled\nOpen the output of **Create a post** and read the error field. Nothing after it ran, so there is nothing to clean up.",
				"height": 180,
				"width": 340,
				"color": 7
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "f131ab04-0a9c-4666-a8c6-eb4a0b923ea1",
			"name": "Note: triggers",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-40,
				620
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## The two triggers\nThese two start on their own when the workflow is active. The demo run above does not fire them, because its post is deleted before it goes out.",
				"height": 500,
				"width": 600,
				"color": 7
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "53e5de98-3988-4a6a-bcff-79c2a6d7b991",
			"name": "Run the demo",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				0,
				300
			],
			"parameters": {}
		},
		{
			"id": "0ece8ffa-62a9-4902-9261-8641aea93281",
			"name": "Settings",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
			"typeVersion": 3.4,
			"position": [
				200,
				300
			],
			"parameters": {
				"assignments": {
					"assignments": [
						{
							"id": "f1",
							"name": "account",
							"type": "string",
							"value": "telegram:Sprkly app private test"
						},
						{
							"id": "f2",
							"name": "daysAhead",
							"type": "number",
							"value": 30
						},
						{
							"id": "f3",
							"name": "imageUrl",
							"type": "string",
							"value": "https://sprkly.app/og.png"
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "6a455206-1c5b-4a29-933c-4af38f3d0c99",
			"name": "Get current API key",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				400,
				300
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "account",
				"operation": "getCurrentKey"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "4cd8e215-3c39-4e53-8156-004720c00c55",
			"name": "Get many connected accounts",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				600,
				300
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "account",
				"operation": "getAll",
				"returnAll": false,
				"limit": 5
			},
			"alwaysOutputData": true
		},
		{
			"id": "40493def-3e8f-4d74-a93b-e8bb621782e5",
			"name": "Add media from a URL",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				800,
				300
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "media",
				"operation": "addFromUrl",
				"url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.imageUrl }}"
			},
			"executeOnce": true
		},
		{
			"id": "47812e76-cc88-4a9c-ae1c-8df00f3c80bd",
			"name": "Download a picture",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
			"typeVersion": 4.2,
			"position": [
				1000,
				300
			],
			"parameters": {
				"url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.imageUrl }}",
				"options": {
					"response": {
						"response": {
							"responseFormat": "file",
							"outputPropertyName": "data"
						}
					}
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "610aa75c-cb72-4c00-99f4-45d4506d6fb4",
			"name": "Upload media",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				1200,
				300
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "media",
				"operation": "upload",
				"binaryPropertyName": "data"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "2037afe7-d36d-4484-abd2-c26d2510989d",
			"name": "Create a post",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				1400,
				300
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "post",
				"operation": "create",
				"accountMode": "name",
				"accountNames": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.account }}",
				"caption": "Hello from n8n. This is a demo post.",
				"scheduledTime": "={{ $now.plus({ days: Number($('Settings').first().json.daysAhead) || 30 }).toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm') }}",
				"postNow": false,
				"mediaIds": "={{ $('Upload media').item.json.mediaId }}",
				"output": "resultRow",
				"keepInputFields": false,
				"additionalFields": {
					"externalId": "={{ 'demo-' + ($execution.id || $now.toMillis()) }}",
					"requireExternalId": true
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "c2c1d41d-d9b5-4356-9b42-6bbe23c98c08",
			"name": "Scheduled?",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
			"typeVersion": 2.2,
			"position": [
				1600,
				300
			],
			"parameters": {
				"conditions": {
					"options": {
						"caseSensitive": true,
						"leftValue": "",
						"typeValidation": "loose",
						"version": 2
					},
					"conditions": [
						{
							"id": "c1",
							"leftValue": "={{ $json.ok === true }}",
							"rightValue": "",
							"operator": {
								"type": "boolean",
								"operation": "true",
								"singleValue": true
							}
						}
					],
					"combinator": "and"
				},
				"looseTypeValidation": true,
				"options": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "5700af88-c9be-4ed8-b271-87c0ed25f3f4",
			"name": "Stop: read the error",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				1800,
				500
			],
			"parameters": {}
		},
		{
			"id": "de2f95de-8131-4f57-83da-dac7fa998334",
			"name": "Get a post",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				1800,
				300
